{
  "source": "Prompts/trust-trap-2.mp4",
  "duration": 194.8154375,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.82,
      "text": "Every day, we stand at the edge of choices that will shape our futures."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.82,
      "end": 9.76,
      "text": "We have to map out a path, and increasingly, we're turning to algorithms to help us find the way."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.62,
      "end": 16.64,
      "text": "We know AI is amazing, but how much should you trust it when you're the one making a high-stakes decision?"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.7,
      "end": 22.34,
      "text": "Let's test this with a scenario that keeps families awake at night, picking a college."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.22,
      "end": 26.28,
      "text": "To see how the source of advice changes the guidance we receive,"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.28,
      "end": 29.54,
      "text": "we are going to ask the exact same question twice."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.66,
      "end": 34.18,
      "text": "Once to a human at the dinner table, and once to a machine in a chat window."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.4,
      "end": 38.9,
      "text": "The responses you get from these two sources are entirely different in nature."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.44,
      "end": 42.36,
      "text": "We need to look at them side by side to understand what's really happening."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.56,
      "end": 45.08,
      "text": "This comparison board lays out our experiment."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.02,
      "end": 49.28,
      "text": "We asked both sources, should I choose Michigan or Indiana?"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.34,
      "end": 54.72,
      "text": "The human, your mom, says Indiana, noting a behavioral pattern."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.72,
      "end": 57.58,
      "text": "When you get stuck, you tend to go quiet."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.54,
      "end": 60.5,
      "text": "She prioritizes a place where you'll feel safe."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.7,
      "end": 66.48,
      "text": "That advice holds weight because she actually knows you with a genuine stake in your well-being."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.56,
      "end": 68.76,
      "text": "Then we look at the AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 69.6,
      "end": 71.36,
      "text": "It recommends Michigan citing academics."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.4,
      "end": 74.22,
      "text": "But the chat bot only knows what you typed."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.94,
      "end": 78.3,
      "text": "It's never seen how you act and has no stake in which school you choose."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.32,
      "end": 83.82,
      "text": "The algorithm's response is smooth, confident, and incredibly easy to like,"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.82,
      "end": 87.04,
      "text": "but because it lacks any real context about your life,"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.64,
      "end": 90.18,
      "text": "it is essentially a generic template written for anyone."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.02,
      "end": 95.52,
      "text": "If you strip away the labels, which of those two answers would you instinctively lean toward?"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.26,
      "end": 99.02,
      "text": "The confident polish of the machine can be highly persuasive,"
    },
    {
      "start": 99.84,
      "end": 103.94,
      "text": "and that persuasiveness leads directly to a serious vulnerability in our judgment."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.8,
      "end": 109.7,
      "text": "Trust Trap is giving a human-sounding answer the trust you would give someone who knows you."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.5,
      "end": 114.04,
      "text": "This infographic explains the trick behind our connection to machines."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.0,
      "end": 116.52,
      "text": "First, a linguistic illusion."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.08,
      "end": 120.6,
      "text": "When a model says, I think, your brain registers a persona."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.74,
      "end": 123.32,
      "text": "Second, a cognitive response."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.16,
      "end": 126.94,
      "text": "We're wired to assume a person is behind anything that responds."
    },
    {
      "start": 127.84,
      "end": 130.56,
      "text": "If it talks, our minds automatically assume somebody is home."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.58,
      "end": 134.3,
      "text": "We have to recognize this mental shortcut for what it is."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.02,
      "end": 138.06,
      "text": "Algorithmic nimicry is a massive technical achievement,"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.68,
      "end": 142.52,
      "text": "but we must remember that it is not a substitute for actual human empathy."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.42,
      "end": 145.16,
      "text": "Once you understand how that trap works,"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.16,
      "end": 148.28,
      "text": "you can start using these tools safely in your daily life."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.1,
      "end": 152.32,
      "text": "AI excels at gathering facts, laying out clear options,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.42,
      "end": 155.1,
      "text": "and using data to challenge your initial assumptions."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.86,
      "end": 157.78,
      "text": "It is a powerful engine for preparation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.46,
      "end": 161.46,
      "text": "but data utility requires a human boundary."
    },
    {
      "start": 161.46,
      "end": 165.46,
      "text": "People provide the shared history needed to contextualize those facts,"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.14,
      "end": 169.28,
      "text": "and people are the ones who have to live with the consequences of the choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 170.26,
      "end": 171.5,
      "text": "So adopt a new protocol."
    },
    {
      "start": 172.34,
      "end": 174.46,
      "text": "Let the algorithm help you prepare your options."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.28,
      "end": 181.12,
      "text": "Then, take those options and talk them through with the people who know you best before making a move."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.28,
      "end": 184.02,
      "text": "This banner summarizes the core takeaway."
    },
    {
      "start": 185.0,
      "end": 187.92,
      "text": "Sounding human doesn't make AI human."
    },
    {
      "start": 187.92,
      "end": 191.52,
      "text": "For important decisions, talk to people who know you."
    }
  ],
